From 81c0dfd6023615730dada91a2ea30db4d4076bc1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nitesh Gupta <nitegupt@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 21:38:30 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] PCIe: qcom-ecam: Add PCIe Safety for sa8787p

Adds handling of PCIe Safety Errors including OCCAP
for paltform sa8787p using dedicated ESPI for corr
and uncorr errors.

Change-Id: Ie451266ce4eb389988485bb957dd9c7f35e8e02f
Signed-off-by: Nitesh Gupta <nitegupt@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
