+ * Re-arm the safety sources that the interrupt handlers mask on the first
+ * occurrence to stop an interrupt storm (RASDP uncorrectable, CDM register
+ * check, interface timer). Without this, those sources stay masked until
+ * the controller is re-initialized, which also blinds the collaterally
+ * masked AER uncorrectable source.
+ */
